<title>UK: Berlin Hypo sets 200 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Berlin Hypo sets 200 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager WGZ Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BERLIN HANNOVERISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.00	MATURITY    14.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE    14.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.45	LISTING    BERLIN/HANNOVER</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10	  MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC   1.35</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR YEAR ONE, THEN STEPS-UP TO 4.50 PCT IN YEAR TWO,</p>
<p>		5.0 PCT IN YEAR THREE, 5.75 PCT IN YEAR FOUR AND 6.5</p>
<p>		PCT IN YEAR FIVE.</p>
<p>		CALLABLE AT PAR ON 14.FEB.98.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
